Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `CellReadGuard<Int>` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_tiers/local_cell_guards_are_linear_before_codegen.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     copied: guard.copy()
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A Cell guard owns one live dynamic loan; copying it would create two handles for the same loan
 Fix: Move it instead with `guard.move()`, or create a new guard after this one is dropped
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211
